                "instr": "Questions 26–30<br>Complete the sentences below.<br>Write <b>ONE WORD ONLY</b> for each answer.",
                "type": "html",
                "html": "<ul><li>The tutor says that the most basic requirement of an essay is relevance.</li><li>Katy thinks the writer separates different [[26]] very clearly.</li><li>John feels that bullet points and sub-headings might be more appropriate for [[27]] than for essays.</li><li>The tutor thinks that paragraphs should be used to structure essays.</li><li>John particularly admires the way the writer backs up his statements with [[28]].</li><li>Katy likes the writer’s use of language to link his [[29]].</li><li>The tutor thinks that wide [[30]] helps to develop writing ability.</li></ul>"
